MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05
      Title: Chocolate Chip Cookies
 Categories: Cookies, Desserts
      Yield: 48 cookies

  2 1/4 c  Flour
      1 ts Baking soda
      1 ts Salt
      1 c  Butter, softened
    3/4 c  Sugar
      2    Eggs
      2 c  Chocolate chips

  Cream butter and sugar. Beat in the eggs. Combine flour, baking soda and
  salt; stir into the creamed mixture. Fold in chocolate chips.

  Drop by rounded tablespoons onto ungreased sheets. Bake at 375 degrees
  for 9 to 11 minutes.

MMMMM

