      Title: Spaghetti With Meat Sauce
 Categories: Pasta, Main dish
      Yield: 6 servings

      1 lb Ground beef
      1    Onion, chopped
      2 cl Garlic
           -- minced
MMMMM-----------------------SAUCE-----------------------
     28 oz Crushed tomatoes
      2 tb Tomato paste
      1 ts Italian seasoning
MMMMM-----------------------PASTA-----------------------
      1 lb Spaghetti

  Brown beef with onion and garlic. Add the sauce ingredients and simmer
  for 30 minutes. Cook spaghetti according to package directions.

  Serve sauce over the hot spaghetti.

MMMMM

MMMMM----- Recipe via Meal-Master (tm) v8.05
      Title: Pancakes
 Categories: Breakfast
      Yield: 8 pancakes

  1 1/2 c  Flour                               1 tb Sugar
  3 1/2 ts Baking powder                       1 ts Salt
  1 1/4 c  Milk                                1    Egg
      3 tb Butter, melted

  1. Sift the dry ingredients together.
  2. Make a well, pour in milk, egg and butter; mix until smooth.
  3. Cook on a hot griddle until bubbles form, then flip.

MMMMM

